WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
Hi Uncle Chen

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:02,720
Where is the reward for this?

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,680
I am also happy to be able to eliminate natural disasters.

4
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,960
Don't look at my low salary

5
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,640
I also donated when there were major disasters that needed donations.

6
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:12,300
Although it's not enough for just one or two hundred

7
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:16,850
I must reward you with a small side

8
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:18,710
I reported it to the superior

9
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:20,710
The superiors attach great importance to it and are very happy

10
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:22,310
If it works four times

11
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:24,710
Will it save countless lives?

12
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,660
Don’t you love reading novels the most? Let me tell you.

13
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:28,940
You put this in a novel

14
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:31,060
That is merit, body protection, and instant victory.

15
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:32,220
Save life from water and fire

16
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:33,300
Thousands of families are born Buddha

17
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,760
Then I can’t even ask for a reward.

18
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,320
Originally I thought this was a good thing

19
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:39,400
If you get a reward

20
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,240
I always feel that the nature has changed

21
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,960
One horse returns to one horse, this is different

22
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:50,740
This is how the country thinks about eliminating disasters. Ten billion will arrive in time and no need to fetch water. What do you think?

23
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,700
I can also help you report to the top

24
00:00:54,210 --> 00:00:55,770
What if it smells bad?

25
00:00:55,770 --> 00:00:59,000
Ten billion times

26
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:01,720
40 billion 40 billion

27
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:05,970
One billion a day, interest is 540 billion

28
00:01:06,210 --> 00:01:07,860
How should I spend these two million?

29
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:12,590
Isn’t this all spent? Uncle Chen

30
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:14,440
Give me so much money

31
00:01:15,470 --> 00:01:17,230
Is it really not going to cause any problems?
